{"name":"potential_ratio_le","v":1,"source_hash":"1c8c5cef82317736","lines":["N T : ℕ","inst✝ : NeZero N","η : ℝ","hη : 0 < η","ℓ : LossSeq N T","hℓ : ℓ.Valid","t : Fin T","ht : ↑t + 1 ≤ T","⊢ potential η ℓ (↑t + 1) / potential η ℓ ↑t ≤ 1 - (1 - rexp (-η)) * hedgeLoss η ℓ t","hWt : 0 < potential η ℓ ↑t","⊢ potential η ℓ (↑t + 1) ≤ (1 - (1 - rexp (-η)) * hedgeLoss η ℓ t) * potential η ℓ ↑t","hW_succ : potential η ℓ (↑t + 1) = ∑ i, hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i)","⊢ potential η ℓ (↑t + 1) = ∑ i, hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i)","⊢ ∑ i, hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t + 1) i = ∑ i, hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i)","case e_f","⊢ (fun i => hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t + 1) i) = fun i => hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i)","i : Fin N","⊢ hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t + 1) i = hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i)","⊢ ∑ i, hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i) ≤ (1 - (1 - rexp (-η)) * hedgeLoss η ℓ t) * potential η ℓ ↑t","hbound :","  ∀ (i : Fin N), hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i) ≤ hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * (1 - (1 - rexp (-η)) * ℓ t i)","⊢ ∀ (i : Fin N), hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i) ≤ hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * (1 - (1 - rexp (-η)) * ℓ t i)","⊢ hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i) ≤ hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * (1 - (1 - rexp (-η)) * ℓ t i)","c : ℝ := 1 - rexp (-η)","hbound : ∀ (i : Fin N), hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i) ≤ hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * (1 - c * ℓ t i)","hc_def : c = 1 - rexp (-η)","⊢ ∑ i, hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i) ≤ (1 - c * hedgeLoss η ℓ t) * potential η ℓ ↑t","W : ℝ := potential η ℓ ↑t","hWt : 0 < W","hW_def : W = potential η ℓ ↑t","⊢ ∑ i, hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * rexp (-η * ℓ t i) ≤ (1 - c * hedgeLoss η ℓ t) * W","hW_ne : W ≠ 0","hHL : hedgeLoss η ℓ t = (∑ i, hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * ℓ t i) / W","⊢ hedgeLoss η ℓ t = (∑ i, hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * ℓ t i) / W","⊢ ∑ i, hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i / potential η ℓ ↑t * ℓ t i = ∑ i, hedgeWeight η ℓ (↑t) i * ℓ t i / potential η ℓ ↑t","⊢ (fun i =